<section class="section section-purple" id="instructions">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Header Card with Purple Aura -->
    <div class="guide-lead-card card-obsidian">
      <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-purple">PLAYING & SAVING</div>
      <h2 class="guide-main-heading">
        The Ultimate <span class="text-gradient-purple">Diskwala Guide</span>: Online Video Player, Link Downloader & Bot Setup
      </h2>
      <p class="guide-lead-text">
        Diskwala and Flezen share links sometimes open slowly or push you toward extra apps. This page checks whether your link uses a supported host, then points you to the Telegram bot for the actual streaming and download options.
      </p>
      <p class="guide-lead-text">
        Below is a short overview of link sharing, what this checker does, and how the <strong class="highlight-text">Telegram bot</strong> handoff works.
      </p>

      <!-- 2 Feature Bento Grid Cards -->
      <div class="bento-two-col">
        <!-- Card 1: What is Diskwala? -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-card-cyan">
          <div class="bento-icon-box bento-icon-cyan">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="bento-title">What is Diskwala?</h3>
          <p class="bento-text">
            At its core, <strong class="highlight-text">diskwala</strong> is a file storage and sharing service: uploaders share links, and viewers open them in a browser. Playback quality depends on the original file and the host page.
          </p>
          <p class="bento-text">
            This site does not resolve private file contents. It checks the link host, shows a demo preview, and hands you a Telegram bot link for the actual file.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Why Use DiskwalaDownloader? -->
        <div class="bento-card bento-card-purple">
          <div class="bento-icon-box bento-icon-purple">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="bento-title">Why Use DiskwalaDownloader?</h3>
          <p class="bento-text">
            Use the checker above to confirm your link uses diskwala.com or flezen.com before opening Telegram. It is free and needs no signup.
          </p>
          <p class="bento-text">
            After the check, open the bot link, send your URL there if asked, and use the streaming or download option the bot provides.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guide-lead-card {
